# Build context hygiene: keep local state, caches and secrets out of the image.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/coverage

# Local databases and backups — the deployed ones live on the §11 volume.
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
backups/

# Never bake an env file into an image (§11 config comes from the host).
.env
.env.*

docs/
CLAUDE.md
